"""Content of the "Création de site web pour <métier>" pages.

One entry per trade. Every text here is specific to that trade: Google penalises pages where only
the trade name changes. To add a trade, copy an entry and rewrite every field.

Fields
  slug     URL: creation-site-web-<slug>
  name     trade, as typed in Google ("barbier", "coffee shop"...)
  h1       end of the title "Création de site web pour ..."
  cat      group on the hub page (see CATS)
  art      illustration in assets/img/art/
  offer    formula we recommend: vitrine, ecommerce or premium
  kw       extra search phrases (meta keywords only)
  lead     intro under the title
  why      2 paragraphs: how customers of this trade search and choose
  feats    6 features (icon, title, text); icons must exist in assets/css/icons.css
  pages    pages we recommend for this site (name, what it contains)
  tips     "Bon à savoir": mistakes to avoid, rules of the trade
  advice   why this formula
  faq      3 questions and answers
"""

